{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MidnightNears Demo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play the demo and experience a fragment of the MidnightNears story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;A turn-based RPG where the demo includes roughly 40% of the full version's core content.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At a lone island in the middle of a lake at the edge of the world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a calamity is spreading...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you work with your friends to dispel the gloom shrouding the island,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">or venture alone to uncover the source of the disaster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(Note: Time running out in the demo has no consequences.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ufeff</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745550/extras/01.gif?t=1747705886\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You realize tonight is the final night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse this bounded stylized world through point-and-click exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745550/extras/022.gif?t=1747705886\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll have to fend off beasts, mutated fish, and even bandits,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">surviving in turn-based combat with a &quot;distance&quot; mechanic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745550/extras/03.gif?t=1747705886\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745550/extras/04.gif?t=1747705886\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use precious resources to craft tools or barter for supplies\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">